---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Scaffold a plugin project for one extension point

Usage: rustman plugin new [OPTIONS] --kind <EXTENSION_POINT> <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>
          The plugin's name, kebab-case (my-auth)

Options:
      --kind <EXTENSION_POINT>
          The extension point the project implements
          
          [possible values: auth, assertion, generator, transformer, importer, kind, report]

      --dir <DIR>
          The project folder (default: ./<name>)

      --sdk <PATH>
          Build against the rustman-plugin-sdk at this path (such as crates/rustman-plugin-sdk of a Rustman checkout) instead of the Rustman repository

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
